OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is a chief constable retiring
OL,4,Afor one month?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter one year in post, the Chief
OL,7,FConstable of Cambridgeshire Police is
OL,8,Fexpected to retire and be rehired a
OL,9,Fmonth later. Why is he doing this and
OL,10,Fwhat are the rules?
OL,12,FLast year Simon Megicks took up the
OL,13,Fposition in the force in which he
OL,14,Fstarted his career.
OL,16,FHe joined Cambridgeshire Police in
OL,17,F1996, where he worked his way up to
OL,18,Fsuperintendent in Cambridge before
OL,19,Ftaking various senior roles in
OL,20,FHertfordshire and Norfolk.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
