OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is a chief constable retiring
OL,4,Afor one month?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe replaced Nick Dean, who stepped down
OL,7,Fin September 2025 after seven years in
OL,8,Fcharge of the force.
